														<r3d:remarks>Description:
Hardin MD was first launched in 1996, as a source to find the best lists, or directories, of information in health and medicine. Hence, the name Hardin MD comes from Hardin Meta Directory, since the site was conceived as a &quot;directory of directories.&quot; The Hardin part of our name is from Robert Hardin, a physician at University of Iowa, after whom the library was named.</r3d:remarks>
